BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-hayy-arts-red-wind-coral-worlds@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260710T131814Z
DTSTART:20260520T060000Z
DTEND:20261026T150000Z
SUMMARY:Hayy Arts | Red Wind\, Coral Worlds
DESCRIPTION:Opening May 20\, 2026\, ‘Red Wind\, Coral Worlds’ is an upcoming exhibition curated by recipients of the Art Jameel Curatorial Open Call\, Huda Tayob and Miriam Hillawi Abraham. Red Wind\, Coral Worlds sites the Red Sea within an expanded and interconnected oceanic terrain. The exhibition traces the entangled worlds that converge across its waters\, attending to the material and affective remnants left in the wake of centuries of movement and migration shaped by trade\, pilgrimage\, and displacement.
LOCATION:Hayy Jameel
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-hayy-arts-red-wind-coral-worlds.html
END:VEVENT
